[00:25.00]1. On many occasions God spoke to men
[00:31.14]By means of his prophets of old.
[00:38.08]Today he is saying, ‘Let all repent,’
[00:42.84]By God’s own Son we are told.
[00:48.32](Chorus)
[00:48.32]Do we have strong faith? Is it real?
[00:54.26]We must build such faith to survive.
[01:00.46]Is our faith proved true by our works?
[01:06.04]By means of faith, we’ll be preserved alive.
[01:21.90]2. We gladly obey Christ Jesus’ command
[01:28.06]To share Kingdom truth far and wide.
[01:34.18]We boldly declare God’s message of hope;
[01:39.72]His promise we’ll never hide.
[01:45.30](Chorus)
[01:45.38]Do we have strong faith? Is it real?
[01:51.16]We must build such faith to survive.
[01:57.22]Is our faith proved true by our works?
[02:03.26]By means of faith, we’ll be preserved alive.
[02:31.12]3. Our faith is an anchor firm and secure;
[02:37.14]We never will shrink back in fear.
[02:43.08]Our trust in Jehovah helps us endure;
[02:48.84]We know salvation is near.
[02:54.34](Chorus)
[02:54.36]Do we have strong faith? Is it real?
[03:00.74]We must build such faith to survive.
[03:06.92]Is our faith proved true by our works?
[03:12.04]By means of faith, we’ll be preserved alive.
